716 0 obj
  << /ActualText (SUMMARY\nI\031m a Computer Science student turned Product Designer and Researcher with 4\053 years of experience dedicated to creating intuitive and emotional experiences\056 Jumping now to design engineering to add micro\055interactions and art to tech\056 Also\054 Architecture Dropout\056\n\nEXPERIENCE\nSenior Product Designer \267 Edmingle \nJan 2025 \023 Present\nPromoted from Product Designer\nRedesigned the enterprise dashboard\050AI assisted\051\054 and the learner experience\054 boosting sales by 60\045\nIntroduced Design System 1\0560 to increase design efficiency by 40\045\056\nStreamlined navigation overall the main dashboard reducing user friction\n40\045 increase in adoption of new features through improved UX\056\nAutomated graphical dependencies on designers\054 saving 30\045 support time\056\nRevamped website for Edmingle 2026\n\nProduct Designer \267 Edmingle \267 Jan 2022 \023 Dec 2024\nImproved main UX journeys reducing friction by 50\045\nImproved Bulk actions with CSV\050AI assisted\051 with a better UX\056\nCollaborated with Frontend \057 Backend engineering\054 support team as well as problem facing users to design within constraints\056\nRevamped Visual Identity and website for Edmingle 2024\n\nVisual \046 Product Designer \055 Zyncspace\072  Side Project Apr 2025 \023 Nov 2025\nCreated the brand identity and website for Zyncspace\056\nDesigned and shipped the MVP\054 website\054 and advertising creatives within a limited timeframe\056\nWorked across product\054 visual design\054 and marketing to take the project from concept to launch\056\n\n\nUI\057UX Designer \267 Europ Assistance \nJun 2021 \023 Nov 2021\nMoved the design process from Photoshop to Figma\056\nRevamped dashboards and introduced metrics for cyber security\056\nRevamped the entire website of Cyberior\056com)
     /K [ 7 ]
     /P 717 0 R
     /Pg 707 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

